---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Returns & Refunds" description="Return, refund and cancellation policy for personalized photo frames.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h1>Returns &amp; refunds</h1>
      <p>
        Personalized products are printed specially for you, so they cannot be returned or exchanged once printed —
        please check your preview carefully before confirming the order.
      </p>
      <h2>Cancellation</h2>
      <p>You can cancel free of charge any time before we confirm that printing has started.</p>
      <h2>Replacements</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Damaged in transit: report with an unboxing photo/video on WhatsApp within 48 hours — we replace it free.</li>
        <li>Wrong item or wrong design printed (different from your confirmed preview): we replace it free.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What is not covered</h2>
      <p>
        Colour differences of roughly 10–20% between a screen preview and the printed product are normal and are not
        a defect. Low-resolution photos print as uploaded; we will warn you during ordering if a photo looks too small
        for the chosen size.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
